rale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \u00e0 partir de la reconstitution du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle extraite du jeu Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Mobile_Icon_EN.png", "id": "5505549282843861", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031325_5505549292843860_5100780693875841273_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=huAq2yHZQ_IQ7kNvwFu8w6v&_nc_oc=Adot6wGg443SHxhEjTXekDds7_p0bhKXaqYRVBRjDEjAtGkmkzsD3GzlicETKI-dpm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWhvZEAwfSD0NtaAEF--JgWGePs0YQQX9y9NcrjJBn_5Q&oe=6B104C78"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_EN.png", "id": "2626086864190393", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031371_2626086867523726_7267842356612940618_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rP-Cqvf3hVsQ7kNvwG2OpRq&_nc_oc=AdrwV_U_FIRXvK--Hi81zy5njAWxvqTSvopjscQ_R0wOzw_aMCKtHq0Xp79Zq0OTrDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVpuO7FldwgjdyA92VPSbCsihK5fwo-quVyiASnRg1MnQ&oe=6B103CD8"}, {"file_name": "VR_Landscape_EN.png", "id": "1543686999397216", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031515_1543687002730549_2548295266512135503_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JFl9tN7qEgUQ7kNvwEevDpZ&_nc_oc=AdqgXbN-g5N4ArcmxSvcWp5MPudD0X1h_ai